<title>MEXICO: Telmex places commercial paper.</title>
<headline>Telmex places commercial paper.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telecommunications company Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex) announced on Wednesday a forthcoming placement of 3.0 billion pesos in commercial paper at a yield of 23.50 percent and a maturity of 14 days.</p>
<p>Telmex said Standard &amp; Poor's had rated the issue mxA-1+.</p>
<p>The placement will be made on April 3, to fall due April 17, Telmex said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9552))</p>
</text>
